  "aliases": ["AlSiO3OH phase Egg", "AlSiO3(OH) phase Egg", "phase egg", "AlSiO3OH", "AlSiO4H"],
  "cell_contents": "Four nominal AlSiO3OH formula units in the conventional monoclinic P21/n cell; the analyzed EOS specimen has the non-stoichiometric central composition Al0.98Si0.92H1.39O4 per nominal formula unit.",
